func somar(int limite) -> int
i = 0
j = 0
total = 0
L1:
t1 = i < limite
ifFalse t1 goto L2
t2 = total + i
total = t2
t3 = i + 1
i = t3
goto L1
L2:
j = 0
L3:
t4 = j < limite
ifFalse t4 goto L4
k = 0
L5:
t5 = k < 2
ifFalse t5 goto L6
t6 = total + 1
total = t6
t7 = k + 1
k = t7
goto L5
L6:
t8 = j + 1
j = t8
goto L3
L4:
return total
endfunc
Analise concluida: programa aceito.
